{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_dce54e72e2904e228da8859d","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Ralph Progress Log\n     2→\n     3→This file tracks progress across iterations. Agents update this file\n     4→after each iteration and it's included in prompts for context.\n     5→\n     6→## Codebase Patterns (Study These First)\n     7→\n     8→*Add reusable patterns discovered during development here.*\n     9→\n    10→---\n    11→\n    12→## 2024-02-08 - US-048\n    13→- Created complete website for Dra. Angélica Lucena - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n    14→- Files changed:\n    15→  - `site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena/index.html` (new)\n    16→- **Design Concept**: Ethereal/Luminous aesthetic with rose, gold, and champagne color palette. Organic blob shapes with floating animations create a dreamy, transformative atmosphere perfect for facial harmonization specialist.\n    17→- **Typography**: Cormorant Garamond (display) paired with Montserrat (body) for elegant, premium feel\n    18→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n    19→  - Animated hero with 3 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n    20→  - Parallax mouse movement effect on blobs\n    21→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n    22→  - Problem/Solution section with visual cards\n    23→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n    24→  - 3 testimonial cards with star ratings\n    25→  - 6 differential items with icons\n    26→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n    27→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n    28→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n    29→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n    30→- **Contact Info**: R. Garibaldi, 1928 - Jardim Sumaré, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14025-382 | (16) 99635-3208\n    31→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena\n    32→- **Verification**:\n    33→  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n    34→  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n    35→  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n    36→  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n    37→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n    38→\n    39→**Learnings:**\n    40→- **Pattern**: Ethereal aesthetic works exceptionally well for facial harmonization/esthetic clinics - the soft gradients and luminous effects reinforce the \"glow\" and \"transformation\" aspects of the treatments\n    41→- **Pattern**: Using CSS variables for organic border-radius (`--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%`) creates unique blob shapes that animate beautifully\n    42→- **Pattern**: WhatsApp form integration is highly effective - converts form submissions directly into conversations\n    43→- **Gotcha**: Image URL from Unsplash (woman's face) appropriate for facial harmonization specialist\n    44→- **Gotcha**: The rose-gold-champagne palette (Ethereal Rose & Gold) creates a luxurious feminine aesthetic that appeals to the target demographic\n    45→- **Gotcha**: Cormorant Garamond as display font adds sophistication and elegance without being overly formal\n    46→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n    47→- **Mobile optimization**: Single-column layouts for grid components on mobile, stacked hero with image below content\n    48→\n    49→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n    50→- **Ethereal Rose & Gold Palette**: `--color-blush: #F8E8E8`, `--color-rose: #E8B4B8`, `--color-gold: #C9A86C`, `--color-champagne: #F5EDE3` - perfect for aesthetic/esthetic clinics\n    51→- **Organic Blob Animation**: Multi-layer animated blobs with blur filters create depth and movement without being distracting\n    52→- **WhatsApp Form Handler**: JavaScript that formats form data into WhatsApp message and opens API URL directly\n    53→- **Serene Sage & Pearl Palette**: `--color-sage: #9CBFA8`, `--color-pearl: #F8F6F3`, `--color-mint: #D4E5DC`, `--color-golden: #C4A77D` - fresh, natural aesthetic with soft greens and creamy whites\n    54→\n    55→---\n    56→\n    57→## 2024-02-08 - US-049\n    58→- Created complete website for Dra. Lara Costa - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n    59→- Files changed:\n    60→  - `site-demo/dra-lara-costa/index.html` (new)\n    61→- **Design Concept**: Serene Sage & Pearl aesthetic with soft greens, creamy whites, and pearl/golden accents. Fresh, natural, and premium feel distinct from the rose/gold palette of US-048. Organic blob shapes with dual organic border-radius patterns create dynamic, breathing animations.\n    62→- **Typography**: Playfair Display (display) paired with Inter (body) for modern, elegant readability\n    63→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n    64→  - Animated hero with 4 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n    65→  - Dual organic border-radius patterns for more dynamic blob animations\n    66→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n    67→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects on cards\n    68→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n    69→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars\n    70→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n    71→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n    72→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n    73→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n    74→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n    75→- **Contact Info**: Rua Milton José Robusti, 75 - Sala 506 - Jardim Botânico, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14021-613 | (16) 99788-7923\n    76→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-lara-costa\n    77→- **Verification**:\n    78→  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n    79→  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n    80→  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n    81→  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n    82→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n    83→\n    84→**Learnings:**\n    85→- **Pattern**: Serene Sage & Pearl palette creates a fresh, natural aesthetic that differentiates from the rose/gold warmth of US-048 while maintaining premium positioning\n    86→- **Pattern**: Dual organic border-radius patterns (`--radius-organic` and `--radius-organic-2`) create more dynamic blob animations when combined with keyframe transforms\n    87→- **Pattern**: Gradient avatars for testimonials add visual interest and reinforce the color scheme\n    88→- **Gotcha**: The sage-green palette feels more modern and contemporary while still being feminine and elegant\n    89→- **Gotcha**: Playfair Display + Inter font pairing is slightly more modern/readable than Cormorant Garamond + Montserrat\n    90→- **Gotcha**: Adding 4th blob with lower opacity creates additional depth without overwhelming the design\n    91→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n    92→- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens\n    93→\n    94→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n    95→- **Serene Sage & Pearl Palette**: `--color-sage: #9CBFA8`, `--color-sage-dark: #7FA68C`, `--color-pearl: #F8F6F3`, `--color-mint: #D4E5DC`, `--color-golden: #C4A77D` - fresh, natural aesthetic\n    96→- **Dual Organic Border Radius**: `--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%` and `--radius-organic-2: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 70% 30% 60%` for more dynamic blob animations\n    97→- **Pulsing Ring Animation**: CSS animation on differential icons creates subtle attention-grabbing effect without being distracting\n    98→- **Twilight Lavender & Mocha Palette**: `--color-lavender: #B8A5C4`, `--color-lavender-dark: #9A84A8`, `--color-mocha: #C4B5A8`, `--color-mocha-dark: #A89484`, `--color-champagne: #F5EDE3` - contemporary, fashion-forward aesthetic\n    99→- **Triple Organic Border Radius**: Third pattern `--radius-organic-3: 50% 50% 40% 60% / 50% 40% 60% 50%` for even more variety in blob animations\n   100→\n   101→---\n   102→\n   103→## 2025-02-08 - US-050\n   104→- Created complete website for Dra. Amanda Gaipo - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n   105→- Files changed:\n   106→  - `site-demo/dra-amanda-gaipo/index.html` (new)\n   107→- **Design Concept**: Twilight Lavender & Mocha aesthetic with warm lavender, soft mocha, and champagne accents. Contemporary and fashion-forward while maintaining premium elegance. Triple organic border-radius patterns create dynamic, breathing animations.\n   108→- **Typography**: Cormorant Garamond (display) paired with Lato (body) for sophisticated, modern readability\n   109→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n   110→  - Animated hero with 4 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n   111→  - Triple organic border-radius patterns for more dynamic blob animations\n   112→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n   113→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects on cards\n   114→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n   115→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars\n   116→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n   117→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n   118→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n   119→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n   120→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n   121→- **Contact Info**: R. Garibaldi, 2042 - Sala - Jardim Sumaré, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 1402